  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Electric Water Spray Kit 02 contains all the non-3D printed hardware components necessary to assemble the TEC-9 / T-15 Electric Water Toy Gun. The electric water gun mechanism allows for continuous shooting, with a pulsing water flow activated by pulling the trigger. The mechanism features a simulated recoil function for added fun. To complete the work, you need to download the model files and 3D print the parts. To complete the project, you need to download the model files for TEC-9 / T-15 Electric Water Toy Gun on MakerWorld and 3D print the parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations of The Kit"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Do not operate the Water Toy Gun without water, it may damage the internal components and render it non-functional."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The switch and battery are not waterproof, do not submerge the kit directly in water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The required silicone tube is not included, you can purchase and cut the silicone tube as you need."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The mechanism includes a simulated recoil feature. Please be cautious of the interference between the housing and the recoil slider."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "You need a H1.5 hex screwdriver to install the bolt handle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Warning of Lithium Battery"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This product utilizes a replaceable rechargeable lithium battery."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Adult supervision is required when children are handling batteries or the charger. Do not operate the product while it is charging."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Ensure the battery is installed correctly. Improper installation may result in short circuits, overheating, or potential explosion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Regularly inspect the charger’s cord, plug, housing, and other components for damage. If any damage is found, discontinue use immediately until the device is fully repaired."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Choking Hazard: Contains small parts; not suitable for children under 3 years of age."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Improper disposal of this product may harm the environment - please recycle responsibly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Charging Precautions"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Use only the officially supplied charger. The charger is not a toy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The USB charger for this product only supports standard 5V 1-2A input. Please always use the original charger that meets the voltage/current requirements, or charge directly via a computer USB port. DO NOT use chargers with output higher than 5V or 2A (such as mobile fast chargers, 9V/12V adapters, etc.), as this may cause device damage, overheating, or even serious fire hazards."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT cover the device while charging, and keep it away from high temperature, humidity, or flammable environments. Never charge the device unattended."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT charge the battery pack if it is overheating. Allow it to cool down completely before recharging."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "If the battery pack or charger becomes wet, ensure they are thoroughly dry before attempting to charge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Lithium Battery Safety Precautions"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT attempt to use or charge the battery pack if it shows any signs of leakage or corrosion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT disassemble, crush, or mechanically abuse the battery pack."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT dispose of the battery pack in fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Exercise extreme caution when handling an overheated battery pack."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0584/7236/6216/files/Electric_Water_Spray_Kit_02.zip?v=1728904673\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/4036/9460/files/3d.svg?v=1715161943\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <span>3D Model</span> </a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/50b4c579d0214eb59043ca8552730139.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\">\n</video></p>\n</div>\n<br/><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Overview</h3>\n<br/>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The <strong>Electric Water Spray Kit 02</strong> contains all the <strong>non-3D printed</strong> hardware components necessary to assemble the <strong>TEC-9 / T-15 Electric Water Toy Gun</strong> . The electric water gun mechanism allows for continuous shooting, with a pulsing water flow activated by pulling the trigger. The mechanism features a simulated recoil function for added fun. To complete the work, you need to download the model files and 3D print the parts. To complete the project, you need to download the model files for <strong>TEC-9 / T-15 Electric Water Toy Gun</strong>  on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/689632?from=search#profileId-1102183\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><u>MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a><span></span> and 3D print the parts.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_p\"><img alt=\"LED Lamp\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0584/7236/6216/files/02_1.png?v=1727579968\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" style=\"width: 100vw; height: 100vh; object-fit: cover;\"/></div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\"><br/>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: center;\">In the Box</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 285px; width: 100%; text-align: center; border-collapse: collapse;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"background-color: #333333; color: white;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%;\"><strong>Item Number</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px;\"><strong>Item Name