\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tb\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\">Difference between <a class=\"link rich-text-anchor __anchor-intercept-flag__ text-content-link\" data-eleid=\"10\" data-lark-link=\"true\" href=\"../../../products/electric-water-spray-kit-01?skr=yes\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"3\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>Electric Water Spray Kit 01 </strong></span></span></span></span></a> And This Kit</h2>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Product </div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\nElectric Water Spray Kit 01</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\nElectric Water Spray Kit 02</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; padding: 10px !important;\">Size</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; padding: 10px !important;\">5.3 x 2.95 x 20.5  CM</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; padding: 10px !important;\">3.27 x 2.49 x 15.7 CM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; padding: 10px !important;\">Auto-fill </td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; padding: 10px !important;\">Yes</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; padding: 10px !important;\">No</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; padding: 10px !important;\">Voltage</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; padding: 10px !important;\">7.4 V</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; padding: 10px !important;\">3.7 V</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; padding: 10px !important;\">Range</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; padding: 10px !important;\">10 M</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; padding: 10px !important;\">7-8 M</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; padding: 10px !important;\">Rate of Fire</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; padding: 10px !important;\">2 round/s</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; padding: 10px !important;\">8 round/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; padding: 10px !important;\">Silicone tube &amp; screw</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<p>Purchased separately</p>\n<a href=\"../../../products/silicone-tube?id=515383607146504194\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"> 3x5mm Transparent 2m (1PCS)</span></strong></a></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; padding: 10px !important;\">Included</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Product Specification</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Color</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">White</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Current</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">0.9 A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Material</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Metal and plastic</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Voltage</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">3.7 V</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Range</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">7-8 m</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Packaging Size</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">100*135*45 mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Rate of Fire</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">8 round/s</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Packaging Weight</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">133.9 g</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Important Notices</h2>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 20px; text-align: left;\">Considerations of The Kit</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">Do not operate the Water Toy Gun without water, it may damage the internal components and render it non-functional.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">The switch and battery are not waterproof, do not submerge the kit directly in water.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">The required silicone tube is not included, you can purchase and cut the silicone tube as you need.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">The mechanism includes a simulated recoil feature. Please be cautious of the interference between the housing and the recoil slider.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">You need a H1.5 hex screwdriver to install the bolt handle.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 20px; text-align: left;\">Warning of Lithium Battery</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">This product utilizes a replaceable rechargeable lithium battery.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">Adult supervision is required when children are handling batteries or the charger. Do not operate the product while it is charging.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">Ensure the battery is installed correctly. Improper installation may result in short circuits, overheating, or potential explosion.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">Regularly inspect the charger’s cord, plug, housing, and other components for damage. If any damage is found, discontinue use immediately until the device is fully repaired.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">Choking Hazard: Contains small parts; not suitable for children under 3 years of age.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">Improper disposal of this product may harm the environment - please recycle responsibly.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 20px; text-align: left;\">Charging Precautions</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">Use only the officially supplied charger. The charger is not a toy.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">The USB charger for this product only supports standard 5V 1-2A input. Please always use the original charger that meets the voltage/current requirements, or charge directly via a computer USB port. DO NOT use chargers with output higher than 5V or 2A (such as mobile fast chargers, 9V/12V adapters, etc.), as this may cause device damage, overheating, or even serious fire hazards.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>DO NOT</strong> cover the device while charging, and keep it away from high temperature, humidity, or flammable environments. Never charge the device unattended.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>DO NOT</strong> charge the battery pack if it is overheating. Allow it to cool down completely before recharging.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">If the battery pack or charger becomes wet, ensure they are thoroughly dry before attempting to charge.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 20px; text-align: left;\">Lithium Battery Safety Precautions</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>DO NOT</strong> attempt to use or charge the battery pack if it shows any signs of leakage or corrosion.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>DO NOT</strong> disassemble, crush, or mechanically abuse the battery pack.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>DO NOT</strong> dispose of the battery pack in fire.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\">Exercise extreme caution when handling an overheated battery pack.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The Electric Water Spray Kit 02 contains all the non-3D printed hardware components necessary to assemble the TEC-9 / T-15 Electric Water Toy Gun. The electric water gun mechanism allows for continuous shooting, with a pulsing water flow activated by pulling the trigger. The mechanism features a simulated recoil function for added fun. To complete the work, you need to download the model files and 3D print the parts. To complete the project, you need to download the model files for TEC-9 / T-15 Electric Water Toy Gun on MakerWorld and 3D print the parts.\n\nDo not operate the Water Toy Gun without water, it may damage the internal components and render it non-functional.\n\nThe switch and battery are not waterproof, do not submerge the kit directly in water.\n\nThe required silicone tube is not included, you can purchase and cut the silicone tube as you need.\n\nThe mechanism includes a simulated recoil feature. Please be cautious of the interference between the housing and the recoil slider.\n\nYou need a H1.5 hex screwdriver to install the bolt handle.\n\nThis product utilizes a replaceable rechargeable lithium battery.\n\nAdult supervision is required when children are handling batteries or the charger. Do not operate the product while it is charging.\n\nEnsure the battery is installed correctly. Improper installation may result in short circuits, overheating, or potential explosion.\n\nRegularly inspect the charger’s cord, plug, housing, and other components for damage. If any damage is found, discontinue use immediately until the device is fully repaired.\n\nChoking Hazard: Contains small parts; not suitable for children under 3 years of age.\n\nImproper disposal of this product may harm the environment - please recycle responsibly.\n\nUse only the officially supplied charger. The charger is not a toy.\n\nThe USB charger for this product only supports standard 5V 1-2A input. Please always use the original charger that meets the voltage/current requirements, or charge directly via a computer USB port. DO NOT use chargers with output higher than 5V or 2A (such as mobile fast chargers, 9V/12V adapters, etc.), as this may cause device damage, overheating, or even serious fire hazards.\n\nDO NOT cover the device while charging, and keep it away from high temperature, humidity, or flammable environments. Never charge the device unattended.\n\nDO NOT charge the battery pack if it is overheating. Allow it to cool down completely before recharging.\n\nIf the battery pack or charger becomes wet, ensure they are thoroughly dry before attempting to charge.\n\nDO NOT attempt to use or charge the battery pack if it shows any signs of leakage or corrosion.\n\nDO NOT disassemble, crush, or mechanically abuse the battery pack.\n\nDO NOT dispose of the battery pack in fire.\n\nExercise extreme caution when handling an overheated battery pack.",
